    "description": {
      "value": "Resembling a massive crossbow mounted on a tripod, but with a pair of arms for torsion instead of a single prod, a ballista flings massive bolts. Also referred to as a scorpion, this weapon requires fewer crew members than the larger heavy ballista and can be Aimed and Loaded much more quickly.\n\n**Aim**\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n\n35 feet, minimum distance 25 feet\n\n**Load**\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Traits:** manipulate\n\n2 times\n\n**Launch**\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Traits:** attack, manipulate, range increment 100 feet\n\n4d12 piercing, single target, DC 19 Reflex"
